//
// Phase 3: stablePrefix = generated[..|generated| - |currentConstrainedOut|].
//   generated_new = stablePrefix + resultConstrained.
//   |generated_new| = |stablePrefix| + |resultConstrained|
//                  <= (|generated| - |currentConstrainedOut|) + sqlBudget
//                  <= |generated| + sqlBudget
//                  <= (|generatedPrefix| + old_steps) + sqlBudget
//                   = |generatedPrefix| + new_steps.
//   The bound |resultConstrained| <= sqlBudget holds from the helper's "at most +budget
//   token-steps" contract: each step yields at most one visible token, and rejected /
